{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trailquest MTB</strong> is a mountain bike racing game set in a open world.\u00a0Ride on handcrafted trails, with features inspired by real-world locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/d195d3971998f6d76d0d12ed6d52cc1d.poster.avif?t=1772225640\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/d195d3971998f6d76d0d12ed6d52cc1d.webm?t=1772225640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/d195d3971998f6d76d0d12ed6d52cc1d.mp4?t=1772225640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/cfebb49309f854a51f8ea250daf4ff21.avif?t=1772225640\" width=1200 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to earn medals, or beat your friends times on the trail leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/378426af912e0de52d39ad5d3e56f3e8.poster.avif?t=1772225640\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/378426af912e0de52d39ad5d3e56f3e8.webm?t=1772225640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/378426af912e0de52d39ad5d3e56f3e8.mp4?t=1772225640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com